    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0004:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:overview:0004",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The following flags are defined:",
      "normalizedSource": "The following flags are defined:",
      "sourceHash": "c7656213e580707414f1b756ad89cf6d295433b6b02c280cc4855b83a06c408a",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Overview",
      "contextAfter": "**Vertical placement**: Controls vertical placement of the subtitle text. If this flag is set, the subtitle media handler uses the top coordinate of the display bounds of the override `'tbox'` text box to determine the subtitle’s vertical placement as described in [`Subtitle track header size and placement`](subtitle_track_header_size_and_placement.md). Otherwise, the subtitle displays at the bottom of the video. This flag’s value is `0x20000000`.",
      "documentTitle": "Display flags",
      "framework": "Quicktime File Format",
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:overview:0005:0001",
      "blockId": "list:overview:0005",
      "type": "list_item",
      "source": "**Vertical placement**: Controls vertical placement of the subtitle text. If this flag is set, the subtitle media handler uses the top coordinate of the display bounds of the override `'tbox'` text box to determine the subtitle’s vertical placement as described in [`Subtitle track header size and placement`](subtitle_track_header_size_and_placement.md). Otherwise, the subtitle displays at the bottom of the video. This flag’s value is `0x20000000`.",
      "normalizedSource": "**Vertical placement**: Controls vertical placement of the subtitle text. If this flag is set, the subtitle media handler uses the top coordinate of the display bounds of the override `'tbox'` text box to determine the subtitle’s vertical placement as described in [`Subtitle track header size and placement`](subtitle_track_header_size_and_placement.md). Otherwise, the subtitle displays at the bottom of the video. This flag’s value is `0x20000000`.",
      "sourceHash": "34b598e271cd704cb0169fabb37378f3b46878b927b8d323b42cfdb87bb8930a",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "The following flags are defined:",
      "contextAfter": "**Some samples are forced**: Indicates whether any subtitle samples contain forced atoms. If this flag is set, at least one sample contains a forced (`'frcd'`) atom as described in [`Subtitle sample data`](subtitle_sample_data.md). This flag’s value is `0x40000000`.",
      "documentTitle": "Display flags",
      "framework": "Quicktime File Format",
      "meta": {
        "marker": "- "
      },
      "ko": "",
      "status": "failed",
      "reviewed": false,
